{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.madoka.third",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "CD 店门口的小舞台",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.madoka.third",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.madoka.third",
    "idolId": "madoka",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……怎么样？",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "很美好呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……啊，是吧！？",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "是的。和我想的一样。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "只要笑着就总会有办法。偶像真是轻松的买卖。",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……不是，円香。那个……",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "我没有否定哦？多亏了这样，像我这样的外行也能做。",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "『心意』才是重要的。",
            "nextNodeId": "100"
          },
          {
            "label": "……不对。",
            "nextNodeId": "120"
          },
          {
            "label": "嗯——……",
            "nextNodeId": "140"
          }
        ]
      },
      "100": {
        "id": "100",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "刚才的照片也是。因为円香全力去做了——",
        "nextNodeId": "101"
      },
      "101": {
        "id": "101",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "哈？没有那种事。宣材照片需要全力吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "102"
      },
      "102": {
        "id": "102",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "我只是普普通通地做了而已。",
        "nextNodeId": "103"
      },
      "103": {
        "id": "103",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "不过『用来做宣材照片有点可惜』——是完成得非常好吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "104"
      },
      "104": {
        "id": "104",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "105"
      },
      "105": {
        "id": "105",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（一句话都还不上。）"
      },
      "120": {
        "id": "120",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "为了别人笑，没那么简单。",
        "nextNodeId": "121"
      },
      "121": {
        "id": "121",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "那真是抱歉。我看起来那笑容就是自我表现欲的集合体。",
        "nextNodeId": "122"
      },
      "122": {
        "id": "122",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不是……没关系。以后你明白了就好。",
        "nextNodeId": "123"
      },
      "123": {
        "id": "123",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "谢谢。",
        "nextNodeId": "124"
      },
      "124": {
        "id": "124",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "那么，在明白的那天到来之前，我就用适可而止的客套好了。"
      },
      "140": {
        "id": "140",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "确实舞蹈和歌可能还差得远。但是拼命去努力——",
        "nextNodeId": "141"
      },
      "141": {
        "id": "141",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "也就是说，不成熟也能做成生意，对吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "142"
      },
      "142": {
        "id": "142",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "我以为社会会更严厉一些。是我误会了，那真是太好了。",
        "nextNodeId": "143"
      },
      "143": {
        "id": "143",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……在了解偶像之前，看起来也许是这样吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "144"
      },
      "144": {
        "id": "144",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "那么请教教我。偶像是什么？",
        "nextNodeId": "145"
      },
      "145": {
        "id": "145",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这个答案有很多……每个人都不一样。",
        "nextNodeId": "146"
      },
      "146": {
        "id": "146",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "呼……",
        "nextNodeId": "147"
      },
      "147": {
        "id": "147",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "円香的答案，我们一起去找吧……！"
      }
    }
  },
